---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+19255550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(925) 555-0199';
---
<Layout 
  title="Leaking Water Heater Concord CA | Stop the Leak Fast"
  description="Leaking water heater in Concord, CA? Fast leak source identification and repair or replacement. Prevent floor damage and mold. 24/7 emergency available."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> → Problems → Leaking Water Heater</div>
      <h1>Leaking Water Heater in Concord?</h1>
      <p>Water under or around the unit is never normal. Identify the source quickly to limit damage and decide between repair and replacement.</p>
      <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Emergency Leak Call — {phoneDisplay}</a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-block">
      <h2>Immediate Steps</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>Shut off the cold-water supply valve at the top of the heater.</li>
        <li>If safe, turn off power (breaker) or gas supply.</li>
        <li>Contain the water with towels or a wet/dry vacuum if available.</li>
        <li>Call for service — do not ignore a slow drip.</li>
      </ol>

      <h2>Is It the Tank or a Fitting?</h2>
      <p>Leaks from the top fittings, the T&amp;P discharge, or the drain valve are often repairable. A leak from the tank body itself means the unit has reached the end of its life and must be replaced. We determine the exact source on arrival so you are not sold a new heater for a $50 fitting.</p>

      <h2>Damage Prevention</h2>
      <p>Standing water can ruin drywall, flooring, and belongings and create mold conditions within a day or two. Early intervention is always cheaper than restoration.</p>

      <div style="margin-top:2.5rem;text-align:center">
        <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Get Leak Help Now</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
